        <p>This site sits inside the Georgia FTZ (#26) service area. Ask about FTZ subzone status and bonded warehouse / duty deferral storage for your product — a customs bonded warehouse and CBP bonded facility option worth checking before you route product elsewhere in Georgia.</p>
