        <span class="tag">Rail</span>
        <h3>Railcar &amp; Private Car Storage</h3>
        <p>~60 spots of private car storage and overflow railcar storage on a CSX rail-served warehouse site — sized to your fleet, so cars aren't racking up per diem as a demurrage-avoidance play in a congested origin yard.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Bulk</span>
        <h3>Bulk Material Storage &amp; Transloading</h3>
        <p>Outdoor storage and laydown yard space for resin, chemical storage, aggregate storage, and steel coil storage. Rail-to-truck transload, cross-docking, and container stuffing for export-bound material, including supersack / FIBC bulk bag packing for PVC and other resins.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <span class="tag">Processing</span>
        <h3>Toll Processing &amp; Contract Packaging</h3>
        <p>Cutting, blending, bagging, and repackaging for customers who need value added before material moves again. Overflow yard space for local fabricators running tight on their own footprint.</p>
